---
// The declaration of faith, kept out of MDX so the Arabic stays one paragraph.
// Wording and transliteration: IslamQA 11819 (cited in StartContent.mdx).
---

<div class="pamphlet-shahada" data-not-typeset>
  <p lang="ar" dir="rtl" class="quotation_arabic">
    أَشْهَدُ أَنْ لَا إِلَٰهَ إِلَّا ٱللَّٰهُ وَأَشْهَدُ أَنَّ مُحَمَّدًا
    رَسُولُ ٱللَّٰهِ
  </p>
  <p>
    <i lang="ar-Latn">
      Ash-hadu alla ilaha illa-Allah, wa ash-hadu anna Muhammadan Rasul-Allah.
    </i>
  </p>
  <p>
    “I bear witness that there is no god but God, and I bear witness that
    Muhammad is the messenger of God.”
  </p>
</div>
